        },
        {
          "id": "passage-037",
          "sequence": 37,
          "arabic_text": "إِلـٰهِي ما أَنَا بِأَوَّلِ مَنْ عَصاكَ فَتُبْتَ عَلَيْهِ،",
          "transliteration": "ilaahee maaa ana biw-wali man- a's'aaka fatub-ta a'lay-h",
          "english_text": "My God, I am not the first to have disobeyed You, and You turned toward him,",
